  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **I'm Still Here** (1 review): Contains a Last Train to Clarksville tease and flows into Thirst Mutilator, On the Line and Train 45 [2]\n- **Little Maggie** (1 review): John Hardy leads straight into it as a segue [2]\n- **This Heart Of Mine** (1 review): Played as the encore, following Pyramid Country into Meet Me at the Creek [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Dust in a Baggy**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **You See It Your Way**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Down The Road**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Shackles and Chains**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **I Just Want To Blow Out Your Brains**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Steam Powered Aeroplane**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Muddy Water Take My Pain Away**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **call back**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **bs2017-12-08.mk21** (recommended): source not stated; 14 songs; 96 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **bs2017-12-08.mk21**: taped by soling (; transferred by soling; source: Schoeps MK21(HTRF) > nBOB> Naiant TB > Edirol R09 @ 24bit/48hz [1]",
